OL,3,GNEWSAFurther #847,000 to be spent on
OL,4,Acouncil pool plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore money will be spent on a council's
OL,7,Fhope to build a new swimming pool
OL,8,Fdespite questions about value for
OL,9,Fmoney.
OL,11,FThe existing St James Pool in the
OL,12,Fcentre of King's Lynn, Norfolk, was
OL,13,Fbuilt in 1975 and has been deemed
OL,14,Fexpensive to run and too small.
OL,16,FAbout #2m has already been spent on
OL,17,Fplans to build a pool within the town's
OL,18,FLynnsport recreation centre, but that
OL,19,Fidea was abandoned because it was
OL,20,Fdeemed unaffordable.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
