OL,3,GNEWSAFurther #847,000 to be spent on
OL,4,Acouncil pool plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Borough Council of King's Lynn and
OL,7,FWest Norfolk has now agreed to spend a
OL,8,Ffurther #847,000 on generating plans
OL,9,Ffor a standalone pool, but still on the
OL,10,FLynnsport site.
